# Ownership follows the two tracks in docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md section 2.1.
# The rule it encodes: after the foundation, do not both edit the same file.
#
# Both tracks are staffed by the same two people (@MyauDev/admin), so listing
# it once per line is what "review from both owners" resolves to in
# CODEOWNERS terms -- a second listing of the same team is not a second
# reviewer. Where a line below says "both reviewers required," that intent is
# enforced by the repository's branch-protection required-approvals count,
# not by this file: CODEOWNERS can name which team owns a path, but it cannot
# require two specific people's sign-off within one team on its own.

# Default: no owner. Anything unclaimed is reviewed by whoever is around.

